    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb8c97f3448dc3f7b5af96e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为乘上了这“潮流”，\r\n新宇宙与你——\r\n能够共度这圣诞节。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15c2460ec84b19952b8140e2bfff7cbf639058a5302bae0a10cbf2016d4e7d6d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b48efd91b030073ce2289489",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我逐渐感受到新宇宙那高昂而崇高的心情。\r\n正是因为有了这悠久历史的不断积累——\r\n才终于有了现在的我们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e0c6f54f4c2128213fd83a4e7fb7a9470ed9c505660f6bd52b55c93fe4b51d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:befd34c3ea95e9931a430c9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们能像现在这样心意相通，\r\n也是无数先人共同铸成的结果……",
      "source_fingerprint": "20014e1f3487c62cee003205afb2e038cf4f1e86854fdedadb3d7b55ef1440ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105109.json",
      "json_path": [
