    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8968c3e9d8c62b46c9e74f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与训练员，一起……",
      "source_fingerprint": "daa30905f5aadce099259db69815f53bd5cb39a6ecf1e88e680556f691077321",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        58,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/58/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c04bed7d40b0b625091f3cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论身处何方，道路总会延续。\r\n这圣诞节——便是来自于过去的我们送上的，\r\n跨越了五千年的礼物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfc46f66f71ab2435374097e3e77da31a5a1c1acc4d206bfbba7466e87429001",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105109.json",
      "json_path": [
