    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f490307ede96dc304f747367",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“KICS”……请闭上眼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a82d91751ee83962f92f73f39a7bde51caaa4a82bffe850465a7186fea31c4fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cc3f44c49c371c5c5456b0c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "愿今后，与赛马娘一同前进的道路上——\r\n能够继续有着那颗银星的指引。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b794be066b7028384aa865dcdb33f56a69074e60e100025d2a731b6931a813c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        60,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/60/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e5809c136624f50ad111d08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然我还是不大明白她想做什么，但总之还是先\r\n照她说的那样闭上了眼。\r\n没过一会儿——",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e026f429fe6308219c0641532b6c085f2595ce1114a0f07f579c69546a10f38",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
