    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f79f9d0dbb7d94a265a96ac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "クリスマス",
      "source_fingerprint": "e07e6dd2c7f5fffab7dfb586998fbb2d3096a0621d7d7d1dfd11def1cad3a88d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b59feb466cccbedfc86e0107",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我与新宇宙共度的三年，\r\n以还算不错的成绩结束了。\r\n接着——",
      "source_fingerprint": "edfd29eb84a05be2f84e6a9a45c9ec93a27ed135ed5954d81e0b09e7193182a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a516226bb1e7b3263e681bd9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——九月。我接受了新宇宙的邀请，\r\n与她一起稍微出了个远门。\r\n目的地是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdb28e99ee92fd8fcafd39a21cc272d55cc2620f9529de733f9f5176d81fd3ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d24c85bce2e5b4ad905352f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
