    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9859f2d776cc9c6daa43f1b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『你』也会搭上新宇宙的潮流，\r\n寻找到“INZY”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da0b4f06f136fcbccbe898c9381303966b62f17e733e63ee6d0acce3fbe45fd5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
