    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c70732e10054db2e778da6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然感觉有点明白了……但还是不大明白。\r\n不过，我理解了她话语中想要表达的一件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14dae7370cb9331fa0cea1c2d90e952dad985bbfffb95984fa4aef27b5c36826",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
