      "uid": "zhcn:dd0937b55a2b484ab3bfef25",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只是……如果，他们的故事能有一个圆满落幕\r\n就好了。\r\n我如此祈愿着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c67fb7cce802427593e10c4d2320191cf41501847eb8b14c2ecb86e27b6a7d3",
